legacy-erp: RHEL 10 image mode VM running the box1 legacy ERP appliance.
The OS is immutable; change it through Git (legacy-erp or box1-ops-erp-simulator).
The release pipeline applies approved images itself. By hand:
  sudo bootc status              # booted / staged / rollback images
  sudo bootc rollback --apply    # boot the previous image (ERP data volume untouched)
  sudo systemctl restart box1-erp-worker | box1-erp-tui@ttyS0
